WEBVTT

1
00:00:35.792 --> 00:00:38.875
I think we can all agree
that things were better under the Empire.

2
00:00:40.042 --> 00:00:43.250
Fortunately. I am still here to protect you.

3
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:46.917
Your communities can thrive under my protection.

4
00:00:48.125 --> 00:00:50.083
You are the lucky few.

5
00:00:51.125 --> 00:00:53.458
But that which I provide is expensive.

6
00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.458
And now I must maintain all of it
without the Empire's support

7
00:00:58.542 --> 00:01:00.792
until the galaxy realizes what they've lost

8
00:01:01.542 --> 00:01:03.042
and demand our return.

9
00:01:04.375 --> 00:01:06.625
Long live the Empire.

10
00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.500
Long live the Empire.

11
00:01:13.417 --> 00:01:14.417
Good.

12
00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:16.750
Now for the bad news.

13
00:01:18.792 --> 00:01:20.708
I am raising your tribute.

14
00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:24.792
But...

15
00:01:24.875 --> 00:01:28.542
But. Your Excellency. we are operating at a loss.

16
00:01:30.333 --> 00:01:33.417
The trade routes are plagued with pirates and thieves.

17
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:34.625
ready to attack at...

18
00:01:38.792 --> 00:01:41.042
Are you saying that my protection is lacking?

19
00:01:41.833 --> 00:01:43.917
No. Your Excellency.

20
00:01:45.667 --> 00:01:47.917
I am saying that...

21
00:01:52.375 --> 00:01:55.250
Perhaps you should all go back to your townships

22
00:01:56.042 --> 00:01:57.750
and focus on solutions.

23
00:01:58.875 --> 00:02:00.292
not excuses.

24
00:02:02.292 --> 00:02:03.625
Does that sound reasonable?

25
00:02:09.583 --> 00:02:12.167
Sounds like a perimeter alarm. I'll confirm.

26
00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:17.792
- I've lost contact.
- Go check it.

27
00:02:20.917 --> 00:02:23.708
There's nothing to worry about.
I'll send for reinforcements.

28
00:02:29.125 --> 00:02:30.917
I will require a revenue projection...

29
00:02:53.833 --> 00:02:55.250
We need backup. On the double!

30
00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:56.750
Code Red.

31
00:03:04.042 --> 00:03:05.167
Lay down cover fire.

32
00:03:07.417 --> 00:03:08.667
Take up arms!

33
00:03:22.625 --> 00:03:24.417
Long live the Empire!

34
00:05:07.792 --> 00:05:10.000
What are you waiting for? Hop on.

35
00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:27.667
Hang on.

36
00:05:54.292 --> 00:05:56.250
- Did we get him?
- Not yet. sir. But we will.

37
00:06:05.042 --> 00:06:07.708
- We missed him! He's under us.
- We have him.

38
00:06:07.792 --> 00:06:08.792
Fire.

39
00:06:53.833 --> 00:06:55.917
What's going on? Give me a status report.

40
00:06:56.417 --> 00:06:58.583
- Has the target been eliminated?
- We've lost contact.

41
00:06:58.667 --> 00:06:59.833
Walker Three is gone.

42
00:07:00.458 --> 00:07:01.583
Send everybody!

43
00:07:01.667 --> 00:07:02.667
Understood.

44
00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:03.958
Prepare to engage!

45
00:07:12.833 --> 00:07:13.917
Get ready. Weapons up.

46
00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.417
Full barrel. Now. let's go.

47
00:07:50.542 --> 00:07:52.208
Give me a status update.

48
00:07:52.292 --> 00:07:54.542
Did you see him? Have you located him?

49
00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:57.208
Did you get The Mandalorian?

50
00:07:59.458 --> 00:08:00.458
Something's up there.

51
00:08:02.625 --> 00:08:03.958
He's on the roof!

52
00:08:04.625 --> 00:08:05.625
Can you see him?

53
00:08:06.292 --> 00:08:07.292
Take him out!

54
00:08:07.375 --> 00:08:08.375
Get up there.

55
00:08:09.167 --> 00:08:10.292
But we're pilots.

56
00:08:10.375 --> 00:08:13.250
- Go now! Do it!
- Yes. sir. On our way.

57
00:08:13.333 --> 00:08:14.500
Get up there.

58
00:08:15.667 --> 00:08:16.375
Set the charges.

59
00:08:16.458 --> 00:08:18.167
- Prepare for exfil.
- Sir.

60
00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:21.625
He's breaching the hatch. He's breaching the hatch!

61
00:08:39.375 --> 00:08:40.375
Autopilot.

62
00:09:13.292 --> 00:09:15.208
I know. I know. I need to get the shot.

63
00:09:45.292 --> 00:09:47.958
You know. it's better if you bring 'em in alive.

64
00:09:55.042 --> 00:09:56.042
You okay?

65
00:09:58.667 --> 00:10:00.875
You see. you catch the bad guy

66
00:10:00.958 --> 00:10:03.333
and they tell us where the other bad guys are.

67
00:10:04.042 --> 00:10:05.792
Things went a little sideways.

68
00:12:26.667 --> 00:12:29.458
Good luck. You're gonna need it.

69
00:12:37.958 --> 00:12:40.625
Messy. Very messy.

70
00:12:41.917 --> 00:12:44.542
It was the best I could do under the circumstances.

71
00:12:45.542 --> 00:12:47.542
The problem is. we need information.

72
00:12:48.417 --> 00:12:51.583
Without it. we're never gonna get to
the bottom of what the Empire's up to.

73
00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:55.833
Just give me time. I'll take out
every bad guy in your deck of cards.

74
00:12:55.917 --> 00:12:57.458
This isn't about revenge.

75
00:12:57.958 --> 00:13:00.583
It's about preventing another war...

76
00:13:03.833 --> 00:13:06.500
and protecting everything the Rebellion fought for.

77
00:13:06.583 --> 00:13:08.792
Does that mean I'm not getting paid for this one?

78
00:13:10.583 --> 00:13:12.417
You're getting paid all right.

79
00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:13.500
Come with me.

80
00:13:22.833 --> 00:13:24.042
Impressive.

81
00:13:24.125 --> 00:13:25.458
Where did you get one of these?

82
00:13:26.167 --> 00:13:28.292
It was from a captured Imperial commandant

83
00:13:28.375 --> 00:13:30.625
who had a big collection of vintage vehicles.

84
00:13:31.125 --> 00:13:33.750
This one is stock. Perfectly restored.

85
00:13:34.417 --> 00:13:38.667
I took it out for a test spin.
They did a nice job on the rebuild.

86
00:13:41.833 --> 00:13:44.625
This is worth a lot more than the bounty on that Imp.

87
00:13:44.708 --> 00:13:47.333
Well. let's call it an advance on the next mission.

88
00:13:49.583 --> 00:13:50.708
What next mission?

89
00:13:51.375 --> 00:13:52.833
Commander Coin.

90
00:13:53.833 --> 00:13:55.333
Our missing Ace of Staves.

91
00:13:57.750 --> 00:14:01.542
No one knows what he looks like
and most believe him to be dead.

92
00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:05.000
Not a lot to go on. What's the play?

93
00:14:05.083 --> 00:14:08.250
I want you to go to Nal Hutta and meet with the Hutts.

94
00:14:08.833 --> 00:14:10.792
They've agreed to lead us to him.

95
00:14:10.875 --> 00:14:11.875
What's in it for them?

96
00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:14.833
Their nephew's being held against his will

97
00:14:14.917 --> 00:14:17.417
by another crime syndicate on the Outer Rim.

98
00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:20.375
and they need a professional
to get him out quickly and quietly.

99
00:14:20.458 --> 00:14:21.458
Where is he?

100
00:14:21.958 --> 00:14:23.417
They'll only tell you in person.

101
00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:25.250
You got a name?

102
00:14:25.958 --> 00:14:27.583
His name is Rotta the Hutt.

103
00:14:27.667 --> 00:14:31.083
The only surviving heir of crime lord Jabba the Hutt.

104
00:14:31.667 --> 00:14:32.917
You ever cross his path?

105
00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:34.625
I tried not to.

106
00:14:35.833 --> 00:14:36.833
So...

107
00:14:37.708 --> 00:14:38.833
do we have a deal?

108
00:14:38.917 --> 00:14:41.292
I only hunt down Imperial war criminals.

109
00:14:41.375 --> 00:14:44.833
I don't work for gangsters anymore. especially the Hutts.

110
00:14:44.917 --> 00:14:47.417
That's right. you don't. You work for us.

111
00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:50.333
And right now. this is what we need you to do.

112
00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:53.958
You don't want the job. I got nothing for you.

113
00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:06.792
Come aboard.

114
00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:10.833
May as well have a look around.

115
00:15:15.792 --> 00:15:17.333
Let's go hear the Hutts out.

116
00:15:17.958 --> 00:15:19.958
I'll even let you fly this time.

117
00:15:20.625 --> 00:15:22.417
I didn't say yes.

118
00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:24.042
You didn't say no either.

119
00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:48.667
She's stock. but she's clean.

120
00:16:05.542 --> 00:16:08.458
Hey. Don't touch anything.

121
00:16:09.125 --> 00:16:10.458
Never touch the buttons.

122
00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:56.167
Identify yourself.

123
00:17:57.458 --> 00:18:01.917
Razor Crest. requesting clearance.
I'm here by invitation of the Twins.

124
00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:08.208
Easy on the sticks.
They're expecting us. We should be fine.

125
00:18:10.917 --> 00:18:13.833
Clearance granted. You are clear to approach.

126
00:18:14.708 --> 00:18:16.750
They've got a lot of firepower here.

127
00:18:16.833 --> 00:18:19.958
Yeah. Looks like they hired the Droid Gotra.

128
00:18:20.042 --> 00:18:22.042
The Hutts take security seriously.

129
00:19:13.125 --> 00:19:16.917
The Hutts have been the head of criminal
enterprises for thousands of years.

130
00:19:21.083 --> 00:19:23.792
They use violence and treachery to maintain control.

131
00:19:26.083 --> 00:19:27.458
Be careful.

132
00:19:27.542 --> 00:19:32.125
We may be their guests. but we are not safe.

133
00:20:16.125 --> 00:20:19.375
We finally meet the legendary Mandalorian.

134
00:20:20.583 --> 00:20:25.000
We are so glad you agreed to work for us.

135
00:20:25.583 --> 00:20:27.833
You will be very rich.

136
00:20:27.917 --> 00:20:30.792
I don't work for you. I work for the New Republic.

137
00:20:31.917 --> 00:20:35.792
I'm told you can lead us
to the Imperial fugitive Commander Coin.

138
00:20:35.875 --> 00:20:38.542
Of course. Mando.

139
00:20:39.083 --> 00:20:41.667
I understand your nephew. Rotta. has been kidnapped.

140
00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:45.083
Yes our poor nephew has been taken.

141
00:20:45.583 --> 00:20:48.250
He fell in with a bad crowd.

142
00:20:48.958 --> 00:20:51.708
We are heartbroken.

143
00:20:52.458 --> 00:20:58.875
Think of how you would feel
if your little one went missing.

144
00:21:00.667 --> 00:21:02.167
What does he look like?

145
00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:03.417
Do you have an image?

146
00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:05.083
Ah yes.

147
00:21:05.583 --> 00:21:09.375
The only image we have is from long ago.

148
00:21:15.958 --> 00:21:19.667
He's had a growth spurt since then.

149
00:21:20.417 --> 00:21:24.000
Okay. I'll rescue your nephew.

150
00:21:24.083 --> 00:21:25.083
Where is he being held?

151
00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:30.667
You will find him on the moon of Shakari.

152
00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:32.667
It shall be done.

153
00:21:52.167 --> 00:21:55.333
We're about to come out of hyperspace
in the Shakari system.

154
00:21:55.958 --> 00:21:57.292
To state the obvious.

155
00:21:57.375 --> 00:22:00.625
you are operating outside
the jurisdiction of the New Republic.

156
00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:05.375
If things get messy. I can't call in an X-wing strike.

157
00:22:05.917 --> 00:22:06.917
I know the drill.

158
00:22:08.667 --> 00:22:12.292
Before going into harm's way. check your armor first.

159
00:22:12.375 --> 00:22:14.833
It's gotta fit snug so it doesn't slide.

160
00:22:14.917 --> 00:22:17.542
but not so tight that it restricts your movement.

161
00:22:18.250 --> 00:22:19.458
Got it?

162
00:22:20.917 --> 00:22:21.917
How's that feel?

163
00:22:46.125 --> 00:22:47.917
All right. Zeb. drop us here.

164
00:23:44.500 --> 00:23:45.500
Yes?

165
00:23:45.583 --> 00:23:47.383
I'll take a flat-meat fry for the little one.

166
00:23:47.417 --> 00:23:49.125
Got it. Okay. got it. got it.

167
00:23:49.208 --> 00:23:50.375
Flat-meat fry. huh?

168
00:23:53.208 --> 00:23:54.667
Yeah. yeah. yeah. yeah. yeah.

169
00:24:02.417 --> 00:24:05.542
That's quite an impressive denomination.
I'm not sure I've got change for that.

170
00:24:05.625 --> 00:24:06.958
You can keep the change.

171
00:24:07.042 --> 00:24:08.667
I'm new to these parts.

172
00:24:08.750 --> 00:24:10.875
I can use some information.

173
00:24:10.958 --> 00:24:13.333
Yeah. for this price. I'll tell you whatever you want.

174
00:24:13.833 --> 00:24:15.292
I'm looking for a Hutt.

175
00:24:15.958 --> 00:24:17.833
Don't mention that name. Don't say that.

176
00:24:17.917 --> 00:24:19.393
What. are you trying to get us both killed?

177
00:24:19.417 --> 00:24:21.500
Here. Keep your credits. Food's on me.

178
00:24:22.042 --> 00:24:23.833
Go away. Thank you.

179
00:24:23.917 --> 00:24:26.500
Okay. never happened. Let's go. Nothing to see here.

180
00:24:26.583 --> 00:24:28.167
Damn Mandalorian. talking like that.

181
00:24:28.250 --> 00:24:30.500
Just out in the open. he talks like... What is this?

182
00:24:30.583 --> 00:24:31.750
No. no. no.

183
00:24:31.833 --> 00:24:34.809
No. no. no. no. I don't want your credits.
'cause I didn't give you any information.

184
00:24:34.833 --> 00:24:36.250
His name is Rotta.

185
00:24:37.125 --> 00:24:38.125
Really?

186
00:24:40.417 --> 00:24:41.667
Something funny?

187
00:24:41.750 --> 00:24:45.125
Yeah. yeah. Everybody... Everybody knows Rotta the Hutt.

188
00:24:45.208 --> 00:24:46.667
That guy's a monster.

189
00:25:33.583 --> 00:25:34.917
Rotta! Rotta! Rotta!

190
00:25:35.000 --> 00:25:37.208
He doesn't seem like a prisoner to me.

191
00:25:39.542 --> 00:25:41.250
Rotta!

192
00:26:21.208 --> 00:26:23.292
Are you here to kill me?

193
00:26:23.833 --> 00:26:25.125
I'm here to rescue you.

194
00:26:27.458 --> 00:26:29.833
What makes you think I need rescuing?

195
00:26:29.917 --> 00:26:31.875
Your aunt and uncle hired me to find you.

196
00:26:33.000 --> 00:26:37.000
Yeah. I see. Well. thank you. but I don't require rescuing.

197
00:26:37.708 --> 00:26:41.833
Tomorrow's the last match in my contract
and after that. my debt will be paid.

198
00:26:41.917 --> 00:26:43.333
I'll be a free agent.

199
00:26:47.000 --> 00:26:48.375
Paid to who?

200
00:26:51.167 --> 00:26:52.167
Who's he?

201
00:26:53.292 --> 00:26:54.458
Don't stare.

202
00:26:55.208 --> 00:26:57.208
It's okay. What's your name?

203
00:26:58.208 --> 00:26:59.208
He doesn't talk.

204
00:26:59.292 --> 00:27:00.917
Who do you have to pay?

205
00:27:01.000 --> 00:27:02.417
Can I feed him?

206
00:27:06.375 --> 00:27:07.583
Sure.

207
00:27:07.667 --> 00:27:09.083
Who do you have to pay?

208
00:27:14.875 --> 00:27:16.292
Lord Janu.

209
00:27:17.667 --> 00:27:19.250
I don't know the name.

210
00:27:19.333 --> 00:27:23.542
You should. He runs the Syndicate
on all the moons of Shakari.

211
00:27:26.167 --> 00:27:27.583
He signed me to his stable.

212
00:27:27.667 --> 00:27:29.833
He bankrolled my board and training.

213
00:27:29.917 --> 00:27:31.792
He keeps you in a cage.

214
00:27:31.875 --> 00:27:33.000
He treats me well.

215
00:27:33.542 --> 00:27:36.333
And after tomorrow night. I'll be my own man.

216
00:27:36.417 --> 00:27:39.000
And with the following he got me as a promoter.

217
00:27:39.083 --> 00:27:42.792
not only will my debt be paid.
but I'll be rich by the solstice.

218
00:27:43.667 --> 00:27:44.833
Grogu. heel!

219
00:27:47.750 --> 00:27:50.250
Don't worry. I'm not my father.

220
00:27:55.708 --> 00:28:00.208
You know how hard it is to be your own man
when your father is Jabba the Hutt?

221
00:28:05.667 --> 00:28:08.083
You see them cheering for me out there?

222
00:28:08.167 --> 00:28:09.167
For me.

223
00:28:09.917 --> 00:28:13.125
It's the first time I'm not living in his shadow.

224
00:28:13.208 --> 00:28:15.250
That's why I fight in the pits.

225
00:28:15.750 --> 00:28:19.042
They feared him. but they cheer for me.

226
00:28:20.833 --> 00:28:22.083
So. no...

227
00:28:22.792 --> 00:28:24.708
I don't need to be rescued.

228
00:28:28.667 --> 00:28:30.417
Where can I find Lord Janu?

229
00:28:32.125 --> 00:28:34.000
Thank you. Closed for the night.

230
00:28:38.833 --> 00:28:41.000
What the hell's he thinking? Damn Mandalorians.

231
00:28:41.083 --> 00:28:44.043
Mandalorians. they don't even come
from here. He's going around. talking...

232
00:28:45.500 --> 00:28:48.583
I just wanna know where I can find Lord Janu.

233
00:28:48.667 --> 00:28:51.917
Don't say that. Do not say that name.

234
00:28:52.000 --> 00:28:53.542
Stop saying it.

235
00:28:53.625 --> 00:28:55.750
I recommend you calm down.

236
00:28:56.292 --> 00:28:57.976
Just. please. please. don't kill me. Don't kill me.

237
00:28:58.000 --> 00:29:00.667
I've got... I've got 12 little ones
at home. smaller than him.

238
00:29:00.750 --> 00:29:01.958
It's... They're smaller.

239
00:29:03.375 --> 00:29:04.917
Yeah. it's just...

240
00:29:05.708 --> 00:29:07.208
I pay him protection. okay?

241
00:29:07.292 --> 00:29:08.292
We all do.

242
00:29:08.375 --> 00:29:10.917
I barely make a living. to be honest.
But at least I'm alive.

243
00:29:11.000 --> 00:29:12.417
Who collects for him?

244
00:29:12.500 --> 00:29:14.167
I don't know. Different people come in.

245
00:29:14.250 --> 00:29:17.417
Sometimes they come here. sometimes
I do a drop myself. What do I know?

246
00:29:17.500 --> 00:29:18.792
- Where?
- Where what?

247
00:29:18.875 --> 00:29:20.750
Where do you do the drops?

248
00:29:20.833 --> 00:29:24.167
I don't... Some pla... Sometimes.
I go down to... different places.

249
00:29:24.250 --> 00:29:28.125
Usually... Sometimes I go to the salt bar
under Korvin Station.

250
00:29:28.208 --> 00:29:30.088
And then there's other places too. You go to...

251
00:29:30.167 --> 00:29:31.958
You know. You know. I go around.

252
00:29:33.500 --> 00:29:35.375
No. I don't want it. I don't want it.

253
00:29:35.458 --> 00:29:37.351
I didn't give you any information. I was just talking.

254
00:29:37.375 --> 00:29:38.667
That's not for information.

255
00:29:39.208 --> 00:29:40.417
It's to cover his tab.

256
00:30:26.333 --> 00:30:27.750
I'm looking for Lord Janu.

257
00:30:32.375 --> 00:30:34.292
Maybe you made a mistake.

258
00:30:36.250 --> 00:30:38.917
Maybe you remember wrong and think you know me.

259
00:30:42.458 --> 00:30:44.667
Maybe you just walked through the wrong door.

260
00:30:46.000 --> 00:30:48.375
Well. I'm not here to buy salt.

261
00:30:48.875 --> 00:30:50.125
Salt?

262
00:30:51.208 --> 00:30:52.583
We don't sell salt.

263
00:30:53.500 --> 00:30:54.625
It's on the ration.

264
00:30:57.083 --> 00:30:59.125
How much for the shoulder candy?

265
00:31:01.958 --> 00:31:03.833
Would look real pretty in a cage.

266
00:31:04.917 --> 00:31:06.417
I'm here to see Lord Janu.

267
00:31:07.875 --> 00:31:09.958
I won't repeat myself again.

268
00:31:58.750 --> 00:32:01.042
It seems you've earned your salt today.

269
00:32:04.208 --> 00:32:05.250
I'm Janu.

270
00:32:06.333 --> 00:32:08.292
Come to the back and pick out a crystal.

271
00:32:08.792 --> 00:32:13.167
Hogsbreth. have the boys clean up.

272
00:32:14.458 --> 00:32:16.583
Make sure I don't lose any pets.

273
00:32:35.250 --> 00:32:36.250
Here.

274
00:32:37.000 --> 00:32:38.167
Choose one.

275
00:32:38.250 --> 00:32:40.875
Salt is of no value to me where I'm from.

276
00:32:40.958 --> 00:32:46.917
But here it's worth a small fortune.
because it's rationed by the politicians.

277
00:32:47.000 --> 00:32:48.500
Which makes it rare.

278
00:32:49.958 --> 00:32:51.625
As are you. Mandalorian.

279
00:32:53.208 --> 00:32:55.292
Have you ever considered fighting in the pits?

280
00:32:55.375 --> 00:32:57.375
I try to avoid violence.

281
00:32:58.792 --> 00:33:00.000
'Course you do.

282
00:33:01.000 --> 00:33:02.208
I do as well.

283
00:33:04.042 --> 00:33:07.375
So what brings you to this establishment
if you're not in the market for salt?

284
00:33:07.458 --> 00:33:10.417
I wanna buy out the contract on a fighter from your stable.

285
00:33:11.042 --> 00:33:13.708
Perhaps you would consider joining my stable instead?

286
00:33:19.875 --> 00:33:22.417
This buys a lot of salt where I'm from.

287
00:33:22.500 --> 00:33:26.542
I am offering you this in exchange for
the fighting contract on Rotta the Hutt.

288
00:33:26.625 --> 00:33:30.625
My dear boy. there's no price high enough
to buy him out of his last fight.

289
00:33:31.250 --> 00:33:33.226
I've been grooming that little prince for many cycles.

290
00:33:33.250 --> 00:33:34.875
setting him up for tomorrow's match.

291
00:33:34.958 --> 00:33:36.000
Take the credits.

292
00:33:36.083 --> 00:33:38.292
It's his last fight for you anyway.

293
00:33:39.417 --> 00:33:40.667
It's his last fight ever.

294
00:33:42.292 --> 00:33:45.333
I've collected the most deadly creatures
from across the galaxy.

295
00:33:45.875 --> 00:33:47.833
He's fighting a Dejarik match?

296
00:33:48.375 --> 00:33:49.500
Yes.

297
00:33:50.208 --> 00:33:51.792
He will die tomorrow.

298
00:33:52.958 --> 00:33:54.458
And a select few know it.

299
00:33:55.333 --> 00:33:56.667
Here's my gift to you:

300
00:33:57.708 --> 00:34:02.000
take those credits. bet it all on the death of the Hutt.

301
00:34:02.875 --> 00:34:07.917
In exchange. all I ask
is that you consider fighting in my pit.

302
00:34:08.000 --> 00:34:12.125
The people of Shakari would pay any price
to see the rarest of sights.

303
00:34:12.208 --> 00:34:17.458
one of the legendary Mandalorian warriors
engaging in blood sport.

304
00:34:26.125 --> 00:34:30.083
This should more than cover
our little misunderstanding out there.

305
00:34:34.042 --> 00:34:36.167
All I ask is that you consider my offer.

306
00:34:37.875 --> 00:34:40.167
Could make us both very rich.

307
00:35:14.333 --> 00:35:17.292
Looks like we're gonna have to do this the hard way.

308
00:36:46.042 --> 00:36:47.417
What?

309
00:36:48.458 --> 00:36:50.042
Janu's planning on killing you.

310
00:36:50.125 --> 00:36:51.292
I'm here to get you out.

311
00:36:54.583 --> 00:36:57.500
Tomorrow's my last fight. I'll be free after I win.

312
00:36:57.583 --> 00:37:00.958
The fix is in. It's a Dejarik match.

313
00:37:01.042 --> 00:37:03.875
He will keep throwing opponents at you until you die.

314
00:37:03.958 --> 00:37:05.708
Why should I believe you?

315
00:37:06.208 --> 00:37:08.542
You were sent by my aunt and uncle who want me dead.

316
00:37:08.625 --> 00:37:10.250
They want you back.

317
00:37:10.333 --> 00:37:11.792
You're embarrassing them.

318
00:37:11.875 --> 00:37:15.625
The Twins want me dead
because I'm heir to the throne. not them.

319
00:37:15.708 --> 00:37:17.250
But I don't want it.

320
00:37:17.333 --> 00:37:19.708
I don't wanna be anything like my father.

321
00:37:20.750 --> 00:37:23.833
When I first started fighting. the people all booed me.

322
00:37:23.917 --> 00:37:27.542
They wanted to see me die
because I'm the son of Jabba the Hutt.

323
00:37:27.625 --> 00:37:29.417
Then I won and became a champion

324
00:37:29.500 --> 00:37:31.583
and they slowly began to cheer.

325
00:37:31.667 --> 00:37:33.667
They realized I'm not my father.

326
00:37:33.750 --> 00:37:35.167
I'm my own man.

327
00:37:35.250 --> 00:37:37.583
and I'm not afraid to fight for what I have.

328
00:37:37.667 --> 00:37:40.500
To earn it. To prove myself to everyone.

329
00:37:41.417 --> 00:37:44.042
Kid. fighting's not a sport.

330
00:37:44.125 --> 00:37:45.958
It's a last resort.

331
00:37:46.042 --> 00:37:48.125
Now come with me before things get ugly.

332
00:37:48.208 --> 00:37:50.542
Guards. he's back!

333
00:37:54.583 --> 00:37:57.042
Get out. Get out!

334
00:38:42.000 --> 00:38:45.000
Rotta! Rotta! Rotta!

335
00:39:04.000 --> 00:39:06.208
Rotta!

336
00:39:33.333 --> 00:39:34.750
I don't want to fight you.

337
00:39:35.667 --> 00:39:37.708
Then you're in for a long day!

338
00:39:47.167 --> 00:39:48.250
Yes!

339
00:40:13.792 --> 00:40:16.542
I'm not going to kill you.

340
00:40:16.625 --> 00:40:18.375
I'm here to rescue you.

341
00:41:05.083 --> 00:41:07.375
Kill! Kill! Kill! Kill!

342
00:41:07.458 --> 00:41:10.167
Kill! Kill! Kill! Kill!

343
00:41:10.250 --> 00:41:12.875
Kill! Kill! Kill! Kill!

344
00:41:12.958 --> 00:41:15.750
Kill! Kill! Kill! Kill!

345
00:41:15.833 --> 00:41:18.208
Kill! Kill! Kill! Kill!

346
00:41:18.292 --> 00:41:20.042
Kill! Kill! Kill...

347
00:41:20.125 --> 00:41:21.333
I yield.

348
00:41:25.875 --> 00:41:27.958
Rotta the Hutt has won.

349
00:41:28.042 --> 00:41:30.708
Now you owe him his freedom.

350
00:41:37.750 --> 00:41:39.375
Rotta the Hutt has won.

351
00:41:40.583 --> 00:41:42.500
Now he is free...

352
00:41:45.167 --> 00:41:46.292
to die!

353
00:42:32.042 --> 00:42:34.833
Our only chance is to work together.

354
00:43:59.042 --> 00:44:00.792
Watch out for the little one.

355
00:44:00.875 --> 00:44:02.167
Yeah. I got this.

356
00:45:13.250 --> 00:45:14.250
We should go now.

357
00:45:14.333 --> 00:45:15.500
Now!

358
00:45:45.792 --> 00:45:46.792
Are you good?

359
00:45:48.292 --> 00:45:50.708
Don't worry. buddy. We're getting out of here.

360
00:46:13.625 --> 00:46:15.833
You were right. The fix was in.

361
00:46:15.917 --> 00:46:17.375
Let's get you out of here.

362
00:46:19.125 --> 00:46:20.750
I'm gonna find us a ride.

363
00:46:43.042 --> 00:46:44.292
Sorry. Mando.

364
00:46:44.375 --> 00:46:45.833
I can't go back.

365
00:47:09.208 --> 00:47:11.042
Zeb. I got a runner.

366
00:48:01.500 --> 00:48:03.708
Okay. you got me.

367
00:48:04.750 --> 00:48:06.667
Can't blame a guy for trying.

368
00:48:24.667 --> 00:48:26.417
We're about to jump to hyperspace.

369
00:48:26.958 --> 00:48:28.375
Where are you bringing me?

370
00:48:28.458 --> 00:48:30.208
It's not safe to keep you chained up.

371
00:48:30.708 --> 00:48:31.917
If I unlock you.

372
00:48:32.000 --> 00:48:33.958
can we agree to no funny stuff?

373
00:48:34.042 --> 00:48:36.083
Are you bringing me to Nal Hutta?

374
00:48:36.167 --> 00:48:39.250
This is an old ship. Sometimes things get a little bouncy.

375
00:48:39.833 --> 00:48:42.125
My aunt and uncle were scared of my father.

376
00:48:42.208 --> 00:48:44.208
They've always been cruel to me.

377
00:48:44.292 --> 00:48:48.167
Now that they control his criminal empire.
they need me eliminated.

378
00:48:48.250 --> 00:48:50.333
You bring me to them. I'm a dead man.

379
00:48:50.417 --> 00:48:51.458
You don't know that.

380
00:48:51.542 --> 00:48:54.458
If you let me go. you'll never hear from me again.

381
00:48:54.958 --> 00:48:56.625
It's a big galaxy.

382
00:48:56.708 --> 00:48:57.917
I can disappear.

383
00:48:58.000 --> 00:48:59.667
Sorry. kid.

384
00:48:59.750 --> 00:49:01.333
I was hired to do a job.

385
00:49:01.917 --> 00:49:04.125
I don't know how you sleep at night.

386
00:49:04.208 --> 00:49:05.792
working for those monsters.

387
00:49:06.333 --> 00:49:08.167
I don't work for them.

388
00:49:08.250 --> 00:49:10.292
I work for the New Republic.

389
00:49:10.375 --> 00:49:12.792
They hired me. not the Twins.

390
00:49:13.542 --> 00:49:16.708
When I bring you back. they're giving me
the whereabouts of Commander Coin.

391
00:49:16.792 --> 00:49:19.750
a high-ranking ex-Imperial operating on the Outer Rim.

392
00:49:20.250 --> 00:49:21.542
It's Janu.

393
00:49:22.667 --> 00:49:25.542
The man you're looking for is Janu.

394
00:49:25.625 --> 00:49:27.000
Lord Janu Coin.

395
00:49:27.583 --> 00:49:30.333
That's who the Hutts are gonna give you. He's ex-Imperial.

396
00:49:30.417 --> 00:49:32.750
That can't be. The Twins would've told me.

397
00:49:32.833 --> 00:49:34.458
I saw stormtroopers.

398
00:49:35.375 --> 00:49:38.167
He brought me to his estate once to celebrate a big win

399
00:49:38.250 --> 00:49:40.500
and there were stormtroopers everywhere.

400
00:49:40.583 --> 00:49:42.583
If you don't believe me and you don't get him now.

401
00:49:42.625 --> 00:49:44.042
you won't get another shot.

402
00:49:44.542 --> 00:49:46.208
In fact. it might already be too late.

403
00:49:47.083 --> 00:49:48.625
That's quite a story.

404
00:49:48.708 --> 00:49:50.417
Why should I believe you?

405
00:49:50.500 --> 00:49:53.542
You're a bounty hunter. you know when someone's lying.

406
00:49:55.917 --> 00:49:57.500
Am I lying...

407
00:49:57.583 --> 00:49:59.250
or am I telling the truth?

408
00:50:19.958 --> 00:50:21.083
That's it.

409
00:50:21.667 --> 00:50:23.583
That's Janu Coin's compound.

410
00:50:24.417 --> 00:50:27.000
Could be big boy's telling the truth.

411
00:50:27.750 --> 00:50:30.125
The place is lousy with stormtroopers.

412
00:50:33.458 --> 00:50:35.500
How many did you see when you were in there?

413
00:50:36.458 --> 00:50:37.625
A lot.

414
00:50:38.542 --> 00:50:41.792
You're gonna need a lot of backup
if you're actually thinking of going in.

415
00:50:42.708 --> 00:50:43.833
Uh-huh.

416
00:50:45.292 --> 00:50:47.083
Get word to all our foot soldiers

417
00:50:47.167 --> 00:50:49.083
on the dark side of Shakari.

418
00:50:49.625 --> 00:50:52.833
I want eyes on the star port and all the freight lanes.

419
00:50:52.917 --> 00:50:53.917
Lean on the mayor.

420
00:50:54.000 --> 00:50:56.250
Nothing takes off or lands until we find them.

421
00:50:56.333 --> 00:50:58.417
Muster my personal security forces.

422
00:50:59.042 --> 00:51:01.250
We're going to hit the streets in full armor.

423
00:51:01.333 --> 00:51:04.042
I don't want to take any chances
when it comes to The Mandalorian.

424
00:51:04.125 --> 00:51:06.417
I've heard many things about those monsters.

425
00:51:06.917 --> 00:51:08.250
It's all true.

426
00:51:09.750 --> 00:51:11.917
Imperial Commander Janu Coin.

427
00:51:12.000 --> 00:51:15.375
I'm here on behalf of the New Republic
to bring you to justice.

428
00:51:16.000 --> 00:51:18.500
I'm afraid we're outside of your jurisdiction.

429
00:51:19.250 --> 00:51:20.583
Take him!

430
00:51:25.375 --> 00:51:27.000
- Set blasters on full.
- Hurry!

431
00:52:26.250 --> 00:52:28.083
I can bring you in warm...

432
00:52:29.667 --> 00:52:31.583
or I can bring you in cold.

433
00:52:55.833 --> 00:52:56.958
Grogu.

434
00:52:58.500 --> 00:52:59.625
Rotta.

435
00:53:00.333 --> 00:53:01.792
Rotta. come in.

436
00:53:01.875 --> 00:53:03.250
Does anyone read me?

437
00:53:04.833 --> 00:53:07.667
- I'm up. I'm up.
- I need you to fire up the drives.

438
00:53:08.375 --> 00:53:11.292
- Fire up the drives. We have company.
- Received.

439
00:53:12.042 --> 00:53:14.375
I don't know how to fly. Do you know how to fly?

440
00:53:15.167 --> 00:53:18.625
Neither of us know how to fly.
and I can't even fit in the cockpit.

441
00:53:25.125 --> 00:53:28.500
Grogu. I need you to go to the control panel.

442
00:53:28.583 --> 00:53:30.583
Remember the buttons I told you never to touch?

443
00:53:30.667 --> 00:53:32.292
I'm gonna need you to touch them.

444
00:53:32.375 --> 00:53:35.125
Look for the ignition relay cutoff.

445
00:53:35.208 --> 00:53:37.333
It's next to the fuel differential readout.

446
00:53:37.875 --> 00:53:40.667
which is between the pump compression gauge

447
00:53:40.750 --> 00:53:42.542
and the primary reserve indic...

448
00:53:46.583 --> 00:53:49.125
No. Don't touch the missile battery switch.

449
00:53:49.208 --> 00:53:50.833
That's why there's a safety guard on it.

450
00:53:50.917 --> 00:53:53.042
Do you see the fuel readout display?

451
00:53:53.125 --> 00:53:54.583
Remember I showed you that one?

452
00:53:54.667 --> 00:53:58.250
It's on the other side of the manual
control surface calibration un...

453
00:54:00.958 --> 00:54:02.833
I don't think he knows what he's doing.

454
00:54:25.208 --> 00:54:26.333
Get out.

455
00:54:30.875 --> 00:54:33.375
Get going. They're shooting at you too.

456
00:54:41.750 --> 00:54:43.708
Good job. buddy. Strap in.

457
00:55:08.375 --> 00:55:09.917
I like this kid.

458
00:55:20.583 --> 00:55:22.417
Come on. Come on.

459
00:55:34.667 --> 00:55:36.542
Get us out of atmosphere and jump!

460
00:55:36.625 --> 00:55:39.750
Get up here. I need you to bypass the exhaust restrictors.

461
00:55:54.083 --> 00:55:56.000
This old junker's gonna get us killed.

462
00:55:56.083 --> 00:55:57.208
I need more power.

463
00:55:57.292 --> 00:55:59.958
Disable the safety panel so I can override the limiter.

464
00:56:00.042 --> 00:56:02.708
How? I'm a pilot. not a meknek.

465
00:56:02.792 --> 00:56:04.917
Just rip out the whole brain board.

466
00:56:10.417 --> 00:56:12.000
Everything okay up there?

467
00:56:12.083 --> 00:56:13.500
Perfect.

468
00:56:20.208 --> 00:56:22.958
I told you to strap in. Always wear your seat belt.

469
00:56:32.375 --> 00:56:34.250
Take it easy up there!

470
00:56:40.625 --> 00:56:41.958
There we go.

471
00:58:13.792 --> 00:58:15.625
That doesn't look like a Hutt.

472
00:58:15.708 --> 00:58:18.417
This is Imperial Commander Janu Coin.

473
00:58:18.500 --> 00:58:21.667
He's full of information and ready to sing like a Yuzzum.

474
00:58:21.750 --> 00:58:23.417
Isn't that right. Coin?

475
00:58:23.500 --> 00:58:26.167
I demand an attorney be present if I'm to be questioned.

476
00:58:26.833 --> 00:58:27.833
You see?

477
00:58:28.333 --> 00:58:30.042
He's full of secrets.

478
00:58:30.875 --> 00:58:32.667
You were supposed to bring back Rotta.

479
00:58:33.792 --> 00:58:36.042
We had an arrangement with the Twins.

480
00:58:36.125 --> 00:58:38.208
This is your Ace of Staves.

481
00:58:38.958 --> 00:58:40.958
This is who they were going to lead you to.

482
00:58:41.667 --> 00:58:42.792
And then tip him off.

483
00:58:42.875 --> 00:58:45.500
sell you out and collect credits from both sides.

484
00:58:46.708 --> 00:58:48.083
Take him away.

485
00:58:53.167 --> 00:58:56.625
Intelligence has been cultivating
a relationship with the Hutts

486
00:58:56.708 --> 00:58:58.333
for a very long time.

487
00:58:58.417 --> 00:58:59.917
and you crossed them.

488
00:59:01.375 --> 00:59:03.167
The Twins can hold a grudge.

489
00:59:03.250 --> 00:59:04.500
I made a call.

490
00:59:04.583 --> 00:59:06.208
I got you the big prize.

491
00:59:06.750 --> 00:59:08.708
The Twins can rot in hell.

492
00:59:08.792 --> 00:59:12.208
Well. you missed out on them paying you
a big bounty for their nephew.

493
00:59:13.500 --> 00:59:14.792
So be it.

494
00:59:16.792 --> 00:59:20.833
Well. I'll see if I can hit up Command
for a fee for the capture of Coin.

495
00:59:20.917 --> 00:59:23.417
Don't worry about it. It's on me.

496
00:59:24.208 --> 00:59:25.792
This one got messy.

497
00:59:25.875 --> 00:59:27.125
I'm taking a break.

498
00:59:28.708 --> 00:59:30.042
I understand.

499
00:59:31.083 --> 00:59:32.292
Mando.

500
00:59:34.958 --> 00:59:36.208
Good job.

501
01:01:00.583 --> 01:01:02.583
We're gonna pull the restrict or plates.

502
01:01:02.667 --> 01:01:05.375
The first one should be just past the return line.

503
01:01:05.917 --> 01:01:06.917
That's it.

504
01:01:07.000 --> 01:01:08.417
There should be three more.

505
01:01:21.708 --> 01:01:23.542
Okay. okay. Okey-doke.

506
01:01:30.125 --> 01:01:31.125
Okay. okay.

507
01:01:31.208 --> 01:01:32.500
Thanks for coming.

508
01:01:33.292 --> 01:01:34.500
No problem.

509
01:01:34.583 --> 01:01:37.375
I'm looking to make some performance modifications.

510
01:01:37.458 --> 01:01:39.292
I need to cut out dead weight for speed.

511
01:01:40.667 --> 01:01:43.000
Pull out anything that doesn't make her go.

512
01:01:43.833 --> 01:01:45.708
Hey! Hey.

513
01:01:46.583 --> 01:01:48.583
- Don't touch me! Don't touch me!
- Heel.

514
01:01:49.833 --> 01:01:51.542
- The horrible baby.
- The bad baby.

515
01:01:51.625 --> 01:01:52.958
Stay.

516
01:01:53.667 --> 01:01:56.750
I purged the fuel lines. I wanna remove all the restrictors

517
01:01:56.833 --> 01:01:58.417
and unplug the exhaust.

518
01:01:58.500 --> 01:02:01.583
- Got it. Yeah. yeah.
- No problem. Yeah. yeah. I got it.

519
01:02:02.208 --> 01:02:03.458
- No problem.
- Yeah. Okey-doke.

520
01:02:04.917 --> 01:02:06.167
You wanna go help them?

521
01:02:08.042 --> 01:02:09.833
Do you promise to play nice?

522
01:02:11.167 --> 01:02:13.292
All right. Go.

523
01:02:19.917 --> 01:02:21.000
Don't worry about him.

524
01:02:23.375 --> 01:02:25.125
Little guy's gonna be okay.

525
01:02:27.292 --> 01:02:29.333
Sorry. I found these in your kitchen.

526
01:02:33.125 --> 01:02:34.917
I was alone when I was his age.

527
01:02:35.792 --> 01:02:37.333
I had to fend for myself.

528
01:02:42.708 --> 01:02:43.958
He's lucky he has you.

529
01:02:44.833 --> 01:02:47.708
Well. you didn't turn out half bad.

530
01:02:49.833 --> 01:02:52.750
Life's messy. but we do the best we can.

531
01:02:54.333 --> 01:02:57.833
Listen. I called a gunrunner
who agreed to take you out of the system.

532
01:02:57.917 --> 01:03:01.250
We both know the Twins will be looking
for you. so you best keep moving.

533
01:03:26.458 --> 01:03:27.833
Thank you. Mando.

534
01:03:27.917 --> 01:03:29.375
It was a fair trade.

535
01:03:29.458 --> 01:03:31.375
Make sure you lay low.

536
01:03:31.458 --> 01:03:33.792
I don't wanna see your name on my list again.

537
01:03:33.875 --> 01:03:35.083
You have my word.

538
01:03:35.708 --> 01:03:37.958
All right. you take care of yourself. little guy.

539
01:03:39.958 --> 01:03:42.667
And keep an eye on your old man. too. all right?

540
01:03:43.917 --> 01:03:45.292
Here you go.

541
01:03:45.375 --> 01:03:47.083
Hang on to these for me.

542
01:04:28.250 --> 01:04:30.583
Let's save the rest of these for after dinner.

543
01:05:48.458 --> 01:05:50.208
Wake up.

544
01:05:50.292 --> 01:05:51.292
What?

545
01:05:51.375 --> 01:05:54.125
- Wake up. There's someone out there.
- What's going on?

546
01:05:54.833 --> 01:05:56.208
- Is it morning?
- Quiet.

547
01:05:56.292 --> 01:05:57.542
Get under the floor.

548
01:06:09.417 --> 01:06:12.708
Wait here. If I signal. get out.

549
01:07:24.750 --> 01:07:27.417
Help! It got me! It got me!

550
01:07:28.125 --> 01:07:29.333
Keibu.

551
01:07:30.167 --> 01:07:31.333
Let's go. Let's go.

552
01:08:22.250 --> 01:08:24.457
Did you get the Mandalorian?

553
01:08:25.832 --> 01:08:29.500
Very good. Bring him to Nal Hutta.

554
01:08:37.625 --> 01:08:39.375
Help me! Help!

555
01:09:47.332 --> 01:09:48.582
Let him go.

556
01:09:55.458 --> 01:09:57.250
Hey. you hungry?

557
01:10:01.458 --> 01:10:02.958
You want a treat?

558
01:10:04.792 --> 01:10:06.208
Here you go.

559
01:10:06.292 --> 01:10:07.667
Good girl.

560
01:10:09.375 --> 01:10:10.417
Come on. Come on!

561
01:10:11.333 --> 01:10:12.542
Uh-oh.

562
01:10:33.625 --> 01:10:35.292
Uh-oh.

563
01:10:40.333 --> 01:10:41.958
Who hired you?

564
01:10:42.708 --> 01:10:44.167
Was it the Hutts?

565
01:10:45.708 --> 01:10:47.292
Well. if it was the Hutts.

566
01:10:47.375 --> 01:10:49.458
I'd make sure they're paying you what you're worth.

567
01:10:49.542 --> 01:10:53.208
But I'm guessing a Kyuzo is smart enough
to get their money up-front...

568
01:12:49.292 --> 01:12:51.042
Nal Hutta.

569
01:12:51.125 --> 01:12:54.292
The Hutts are there. I don't like it.

570
01:13:14.958 --> 01:13:16.208
Wow! I'm coming.

571
01:13:24.542 --> 01:13:27.167
Kid. don't be scared. Don't be scared. It's okay. yeah.

572
01:13:27.250 --> 01:13:28.333
Come on. let's go.

573
01:13:41.333 --> 01:13:43.625
Hello! It's me. it's me! You're here.

574
01:13:43.708 --> 01:13:46.417
You came for me! You found me!

575
01:13:47.875 --> 01:13:49.458
We thought you were dead.

576
01:13:50.417 --> 01:13:52.000
Mandalorian. he saved me.

577
01:13:52.083 --> 01:13:54.125
Big guy. He's inside there.

578
01:13:54.208 --> 01:13:57.958
Yeah. we got to go and find him
and bring him home for the baby.

579
01:13:59.833 --> 01:14:02.792
The big thing. The big dog. The big dog. The big...

580
01:14:03.292 --> 01:14:05.625
It picked me up...

581
01:14:16.000 --> 01:14:18.542
Mando is in there. In the palace.

582
01:14:31.292 --> 01:14:32.958
Come on. Up. up. up. up.

583
01:14:33.042 --> 01:14:34.875
Come on. baby. You can do it.

584
01:14:43.167 --> 01:14:44.917
Big pipe. huh?

585
01:15:13.292 --> 01:15:14.833
Good shot. baby.

586
01:15:37.042 --> 01:15:39.500
Pay the hunter.

587
01:15:55.042 --> 01:15:58.208
You broke our agreement.

588
01:15:58.292 --> 01:16:00.458
Now you must pay.

589
01:16:01.250 --> 01:16:02.917
Bring me his helmet.

590
01:16:13.000 --> 01:16:15.875
Mandalorian steel.

591
01:16:15.958 --> 01:16:19.667
Priceless on the black market.

592
01:16:21.042 --> 01:16:24.458
But worth even more is knowing

593
01:16:24.542 --> 01:16:28.250
we have shamed you forever.

594
01:16:28.875 --> 01:16:31.625
We know the Mandalorian Creed.

595
01:16:32.167 --> 01:16:37.417
You will be outcast for letting an enemy see your face.

596
01:16:38.083 --> 01:16:39.708
Not if you all die.

597
01:16:43.417 --> 01:16:46.792
It will bring us ecstasy

598
01:16:46.875 --> 01:16:51.750
to watch your strong spirit break.

599
01:17:00.792 --> 01:17:01.792
Monsters.

600
01:17:02.500 --> 01:17:04.208
You did this to him.

601
01:17:04.292 --> 01:17:09.500
Rotta would have died painlessly. but you betrayed us.

602
01:17:09.583 --> 01:17:13.083
Now he will suffer for centuries.

603
01:17:13.625 --> 01:17:18.667
You see. Hutts live for hundreds of years.

604
01:17:19.458 --> 01:17:24.000
Just like your small. green child.

605
01:17:24.500 --> 01:17:26.583
One day you will die.

606
01:17:26.667 --> 01:17:30.542
and Grogu will be without you to protect him.

607
01:17:30.625 --> 01:17:35.042
And then. it will be his turn to suffer.

608
01:20:27.292 --> 01:20:29.875
You have entertained us.

609
01:20:30.667 --> 01:20:32.917
Here is your reward.

610
01:22:31.917 --> 01:22:33.917
Uh-oh. Which way?

611
01:23:38.458 --> 01:23:42.208
Even if you win. you will die from the poison.

612
01:24:08.292 --> 01:24:09.417
Dank farrik.

613
01:24:12.750 --> 01:24:14.000
Get out! Go!

614
01:24:16.125 --> 01:24:18.667
Come on. go! Go. go!

615
01:24:32.667 --> 01:24:35.500
- Oh. yeah!
- Wow!

616
01:24:35.583 --> 01:24:36.958
Wait. Wait.

617
01:25:05.375 --> 01:25:06.458
You okay?

618
01:25:13.000 --> 01:25:15.417
- How did you get here?
- We got a ship.

619
01:25:15.500 --> 01:25:16.958
That way. Let's go!

620
01:25:23.583 --> 01:25:27.375
Send the droids! Release the Amani! Don't let him escape!

621
01:25:53.000 --> 01:25:54.792
This way. This way. yeah.

622
01:26:06.875 --> 01:26:08.125
This way!

623
01:26:15.083 --> 01:26:16.833
Up. up. up. up. going up!

624
01:26:16.917 --> 01:26:18.833
I don't want to fall. I don't want to.

625
01:26:19.542 --> 01:26:20.542
Go!

626
01:26:20.625 --> 01:26:22.750
Yeah. Okay. okay. Yeah. Let's go.

627
01:26:35.583 --> 01:26:37.958
Go. kid. I can't fit in that thing.

628
01:26:39.250 --> 01:26:41.000
but you have to leave.

629
01:26:43.542 --> 01:26:44.750
Don't worry.

630
01:26:45.375 --> 01:26:47.125
I'll be right behind you.

631
01:26:51.250 --> 01:26:53.667
Go now. I'll hold them off.

632
01:26:54.208 --> 01:26:56.125
We'll come back for you. Mando.

633
01:26:59.958 --> 01:27:01.208
Come on. baby.

634
01:27:01.292 --> 01:27:03.167
Don't worry. We'll be back.

635
01:27:03.250 --> 01:27:05.500
Yeah. let's go. Let's go.

636
01:27:05.583 --> 01:27:06.750
Come on. baby.

637
01:28:37.667 --> 01:28:39.083
Goodbye. kid.

638
01:31:33.042 --> 01:31:34.875
No life force detected.

639
01:37:32.417 --> 01:37:35.125
Methinks you are the one who stole my fish.

640
01:37:49.208 --> 01:37:51.875
I'm guessing you're not from around here.

641
01:37:55.833 --> 01:37:58.833
A morsel like you should be more careful.

642
01:37:58.917 --> 01:38:02.417
You look to be the bottom of the Nal Hutta food chain.

643
01:38:03.917 --> 01:38:07.792
I'm surprised you haven't found your way
to the Hutts' supper table.

644
01:38:10.375 --> 01:38:12.208
You've heard of the Hutts. have you?

645
01:38:13.417 --> 01:38:14.667
Are you scared?

646
01:38:16.458 --> 01:38:17.583
You should be.

647
01:38:18.083 --> 01:38:21.083
They would swallow you whole given half a chance.

648
01:38:25.542 --> 01:38:27.333
Make yourself scarce.

649
01:38:50.167 --> 01:38:51.167
Uh-huh.

650
01:39:26.125 --> 01:39:27.292
Hey.

651
01:39:29.167 --> 01:39:30.750
Get away from my fish.

652
01:39:35.750 --> 01:39:36.750
Keibu.

653
01:39:58.000 --> 01:40:00.000
The hunter says you have a partner.

654
01:40:01.625 --> 01:40:04.542
Says you two escaped the Twins.

655
01:40:04.625 --> 01:40:06.500
Well. that's impressive.

656
01:40:12.167 --> 01:40:14.875
Says your partner's hurt real bad.

657
01:40:14.958 --> 01:40:18.208
Bit by a dragon snake. Poisoned.

658
01:40:22.375 --> 01:40:24.667
I want you to feed this to him.

659
01:40:26.958 --> 01:40:30.125
Now. you should know. this might be too little. too late.

660
01:40:30.625 --> 01:40:33.375
and there's a good chance he doesn't wake up.

661
01:40:37.792 --> 01:40:41.458
Either way. best thing you can do
right now is make him comfortable.

662
01:40:42.417 --> 01:40:45.583
There comes a time where we all have to say goodbye.

663
01:40:52.833 --> 01:40:55.250
I wish you luck. small traveler.

664
01:43:43.000 --> 01:43:44.042
Hey. kiddo.

665
01:43:49.833 --> 01:43:53.042
The old protect the young.
and then the young protect the old.

666
01:43:54.167 --> 01:43:55.500
This is the Way.

667
01:43:58.667 --> 01:44:00.333
Now how do we get off this planet?

668
01:44:07.500 --> 01:44:10.042
That's the gunrunner that was carrying Rotta.

669
01:46:24.708 --> 01:46:28.417
Well. kid. the way I see it we got two choices.

670
01:46:29.125 --> 01:46:31.583
We can use this ship. Get off world.

671
01:46:32.250 --> 01:46:34.750
That might buy us some time. A little bit of peace.

672
01:46:35.250 --> 01:46:37.458
But the Hutts will keep coming for us.

673
01:46:38.542 --> 01:46:40.292
Just like they came for Rotta.

674
01:46:43.417 --> 01:46:44.500
So. do we run?

675
01:46:48.792 --> 01:46:49.875
Or do we fight?

676
01:47:51.583 --> 01:47:53.375
Repel the intruders!

677
01:47:53.458 --> 01:47:54.667
Roger. roger!

678
01:47:55.625 --> 01:47:57.042
Protect the palace!

679
01:47:57.125 --> 01:47:58.125
Affirmative.

680
01:48:07.583 --> 01:48:08.708
Follow my lead.

681
01:48:13.125 --> 01:48:14.208
Fire!

682
01:48:25.167 --> 01:48:26.708
Come on. Come on.

683
01:49:05.500 --> 01:49:07.042
On me.

684
01:49:50.708 --> 01:49:51.708
Fall back!

685
01:52:28.250 --> 01:52:30.333
Wait! We know much.

686
01:52:30.417 --> 01:52:31.917
Go help Rotta.

687
01:52:40.125 --> 01:52:41.667
You saw my face.

688
01:52:42.583 --> 01:52:43.583
Stop!

689
01:52:44.333 --> 01:52:45.833
Now it's time to die.

690
01:53:54.750 --> 01:53:55.958
Leave him alone!

691
01:54:18.125 --> 01:54:20.917
You don't have Jabba to protect you.

692
01:54:21.500 --> 01:54:22.958
I'm not little anymore!

693
01:55:54.208 --> 01:55:57.458
Stop! You'll kill us all!

694
01:56:42.000 --> 01:56:43.542
Save us. bounty hunter!

695
01:56:46.000 --> 01:56:47.667
Save us!

696
01:57:22.000 --> 01:57:24.667
We don't have much time. We have to get out of here.

697
01:57:25.625 --> 01:57:26.833
Is there another way out?

698
01:57:26.917 --> 01:57:29.583
- I think it's that way.
- Go. Go!

699
01:57:46.083 --> 01:57:47.083
Target sighted.

700
01:58:13.250 --> 01:58:15.875
- Hello?
- Mando! We came back.

701
01:58:15.958 --> 01:58:17.208
- What?
- We came back.

702
01:58:17.292 --> 01:58:19.042
We told you we would.

703
01:58:26.042 --> 01:58:29.000
Adelphi Squadron. entering atmosphere.

704
01:58:29.958 --> 01:58:32.667
- What's your status. Mando?
- We're under attack.

705
01:58:33.667 --> 01:58:35.000
There are too many.

706
01:58:35.083 --> 01:58:37.083
Fire everything you have at my location.

707
01:58:38.625 --> 01:58:41.833
- Your location?
- Yes. my location.

708
01:58:41.917 --> 01:58:43.417
I can't give that order.

709
01:58:43.500 --> 01:58:44.917
Don't worry...

710
01:58:46.917 --> 01:58:49.125
We'll be out of here by the time you do.

711
01:58:50.750 --> 01:58:51.833
Good luck.

712
01:58:55.375 --> 01:58:56.667
Blue Leader to squadron.

713
01:58:57.250 --> 01:59:00.292
assume defensive formation. prepare to engage.

714
01:59:00.375 --> 01:59:01.542
All weapons hot.

715
01:59:01.625 --> 01:59:03.000
Copy that.

716
01:59:20.083 --> 01:59:21.875
Enemy fighters approaching.

717
01:59:24.000 --> 01:59:25.458
Here they come.

718
01:59:52.167 --> 01:59:53.500
Turbolasers. up ahead.

719
01:59:53.583 --> 01:59:54.750
Got it.

720
02:00:15.625 --> 02:00:17.042
I've got one on my tail.

721
02:00:20.250 --> 02:00:21.250
I got you.

722
02:00:31.417 --> 02:00:33.042
Yippee! Yay!

723
02:00:33.125 --> 02:00:34.708
Taking out the launch tubes.

724
02:00:42.458 --> 02:00:45.333
Blue Leader to Red Jammer. mark it and lock it in.

725
02:00:47.833 --> 02:00:48.958
Locking in target.

726
02:00:52.667 --> 02:00:53.708
It's a dead end.

727
02:00:55.000 --> 02:00:56.417
We're trapped.

728
02:00:57.125 --> 02:00:58.333
Stand back.

729
02:01:04.708 --> 02:01:06.042
We're closing fast.

730
02:01:06.125 --> 02:01:09.208
Repeat. we're closing fast.
You better be out of there. Mando.

731
02:01:09.292 --> 02:01:10.708
Jump.

732
02:01:10.792 --> 02:01:12.875
That's a long way down.

733
02:01:12.958 --> 02:01:14.167
Closing on target.

734
02:01:15.708 --> 02:01:18.000
- We gotta jump.
- Moat's not that deep.

735
02:01:18.083 --> 02:01:20.125
It's a bomber. Jump.

736
02:01:20.208 --> 02:01:22.000
Let's light up this swamp.

737
02:01:56.792 --> 02:01:58.417
Anybody got eyes on Mando?

738
02:01:58.958 --> 02:01:59.958
There they are.

739
02:02:04.500 --> 02:02:08.250
Zeb. go collect the trash.

740
02:02:16.375 --> 02:02:19.167
I'm getting a little tired of these hot extractions.

741
02:02:20.083 --> 02:02:21.583
What took you so long?

742
02:02:23.333 --> 02:02:24.500
Hop in.

743
02:02:24.583 --> 02:02:26.417
Let's head home.

744
02:02:49.333 --> 02:02:50.708
Colonel.

745
02:02:52.917 --> 02:02:54.417
Messy.

746
02:02:55.000 --> 02:02:56.250
Very messy.

747
02:02:57.458 --> 02:03:00.667
Why'd you come for me? That wasn't part of the mission.

748
02:03:01.417 --> 02:03:04.542
You were right. Coin told us everything.

749
02:03:05.042 --> 02:03:06.667
The Twins were playing us.

750
02:03:06.750 --> 02:03:09.292
Feeding information to the Empire all along.

751
02:03:10.625 --> 02:03:13.292
They picked a side. It wasn't ours.

752
02:03:13.917 --> 02:03:17.542
Besides. we don't leave our own behind.

753
02:03:18.083 --> 02:03:19.875
I'm an independent contractor.

754
02:03:19.958 --> 02:03:22.958
Sure. Mando. Sure you are.

755
02:03:33.583 --> 02:03:35.500
Can I give you a ride somewhere?

756
02:03:35.583 --> 02:03:37.792
Actually. I was thinking I could stay here.

757
02:03:38.583 --> 02:03:40.375
Maybe work for the New Republic.

758
02:03:40.958 --> 02:03:45.542
Don't take this the wrong way.
but I'm not sure you would fit in.

759
02:03:45.625 --> 02:03:49.792
You know. I might have a uniform that would fit him.

760
02:03:50.833 --> 02:03:53.708
Come on. let me buy you a drink.

761
02:03:55.500 --> 02:03:58.042
Thank you. Mando. I owe you big time.

762
02:03:58.125 --> 02:03:59.458
Just doing my job.

763
02:04:00.083 --> 02:04:01.083
And keep an eye on him.

764
02:04:02.208 --> 02:04:03.917
Your dad's one of the good ones.

765
02:04:18.292 --> 02:04:19.583
Come on. big guy.

766
02:04:20.750 --> 02:04:23.250
Watch your step. First round's on me.

767
02:04:32.292 --> 02:04:34.417
Hey. kid. Come up here.

768
02:04:54.083 --> 02:04:55.292
Your turn.

769
02:04:58.208 --> 02:04:59.208
Go ahead.
